        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Loads and SHA-256-verifies the adult *Danio rerio* right lateral photograph (`datasets/zebrafish_three_cell_stripes/danio_rerio_specimen.jpg`), segments 4 dark melanophore stripes (y = [55, 81, 106, 126] px) and xanthophore interstripes in the trunk flank ROI `[220, 125, 460, 265]` plus caudal fin ROI `[55, 130, 185, 255]` (L473-544), overlays the segmented stripe centerlines, and compares standardized dorsoventral pigment profiles against the 2D PDE anti-phase (u, v) profiles in Panel G." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
